        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gordon Waller, Paul McCartney\n- Products: \"A World Without Love\"\n- Organizations: Peter and Gordon\n\nFacts:\n- Gordon Waller was born on 4 June 1945 and died on 17 July 2009.\n- Gordon Waller was a British singer-songwriter-guitarist.\n- Gordon Waller was best known as Gordon in the 1960s pop music duo Peter and Gordon.\n- Peter and Gordon's biggest hit was the No. 1 million-selling song \"A World Without Love\".\n- Paul McCartney wrote \"A World Without Love,\" and the song was attributed to Lennon-McCartney.",
